{
  "_comment": "A row of pale spines down the back (B5, the Ender Dragon's: the vanilla dragon's back): one at the nape, four on the chest between the wings, one on the waist and one over the tail's root, each a plate standing 1.15-1.8 px out of the back with a peaked outline (seen from the side a row of points), on fine_ bones; trim (end stone). `shell` 1 builds each spine 0.12 px larger all round and glowing: worn a second time with `\"phase\": 3`, those shells on p3_ bones light the spines from phase 3 only (the phase texture shows from phase 2, so a phase-3 glow needs its own pieces, as Hinae's streamers do).",
  "id": "markings/dorsal_spines",
  "category": "markings",
  "slots": {"main": "trim"},
  "params": {"shell": {"default": 0, "max": 1, "min": 0}},
  "occupies": ["spine"],
  "vars": {"step": "(chest_top - waist_y) / 4.5", "g": "shell * 0.12"},
  "cubes": [
    {"name": "n1", "fine": true, "bone": "neck", "origin": ["-0.45 - g", "chest_top + 0.35 - g", "neck_d / 2 - 0.1"], "size": ["0.9 + 2 * g", "1.1 + 2 * g", "1.15 + g"], "material": "bone", "cutout": "peak"},
    {"name": "s1", "fine": true, "bone": "chest", "origin": ["-0.55 - g", "chest_top - 0.55 - 1.5 - g", "chest_d / 2 - 0.1"], "size": ["1.1 + 2 * g", "1.5 + 2 * g", "1.55 + g"], "material": "bone", "cutout": "peak"},
    {"name": "s2", "fine": true, "bone": "chest", "origin": ["-0.6 - g", "chest_top - 0.55 - step - 1.6 - g", "chest_d / 2 - 0.1"], "size": ["1.2 + 2 * g", "1.6 + 2 * g", "1.8 + g"], "material": "bone", "cutout": "peak"},
    {"name": "s3", "fine": true, "bone": "chest", "origin": ["-0.6 - g", "chest_top - 0.55 - 2 * step - 1.6 - g", "chest_d / 2 - 0.1"], "size": ["1.2 + 2 * g", "1.6 + 2 * g", "1.8 + g"], "material": "bone", "cutout": "peak"},
    {"name": "s4", "fine": true, "bone": "chest", "origin": ["-0.55 - g", "chest_top - 0.55 - 3 * step - 1.5 - g", "chest_d / 2 - 0.1"], "size": ["1.1 + 2 * g", "1.5 + 2 * g", "1.6 + g"], "material": "bone", "cutout": "peak"},
    {"name": "w1", "fine": true, "bone": "waist", "origin": ["-0.5 - g", "waist_y + 0.15 - g", "waist_d / 2 - 0.1"], "size": ["1.0 + 2 * g", "1.4 + 2 * g", "1.45 + g"], "material": "bone", "cutout": "peak"},
    {"name": "h1", "fine": true, "bone": "body", "origin": ["-0.45 - g", "hip_y + 1.6 - g", "hips_d / 2 - 0.1"], "size": ["0.9 + 2 * g", "1.2 + 2 * g", "1.25 + g"], "material": "bone", "cutout": "peak"}
  ],
  "paint": [
    {"cubes": ["#*"], "overlay": true, "pattern": {"type": "solid", "slots": ["main"]}, "glow": true, "when": "shell"}
  ]
}
